  "description": "Thai word segmentation identical to the JDK's java.text.BreakIterator.getWordInstance(new Locale(\"th\")): a C# port of OpenJDK's dictionary-based break iterator with the JDK's Thai rule data and dictionary. Also provides the JDK's root-locale sentence break iterator (BreakIterator.getSentenceInstance(Locale.ROOT)), which Lucene's ThaiTokenizer uses to split text into sentences. Licensed GPL-2.0-only WITH Classpath-exception-2.0, separately from the Apache-2.0 LuceneSharp packages.",
